# Testing

Priorities: business rules (inventory, sales, money, permissions, tenant isolation),
Convex mutations, shared utilities, critical UI, failure paths.

Cover invalid states that must be impossible: negative stock, editing completed
sales, unauthorized actions, cross-organization reads.
